  "data": {
    "cid": "2634",
    "title": "收集的物品",
    "category": 4,
    "header": "收集的物品",
    "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"d849c7b85406c4340913d2d5ae672a62\" title=\"克莱布拉松子爵的遗嘱残片.png\" alt=\"克莱布拉松子爵的遗嘱残片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/d849c7b85406c4340913d2d5ae672a62.png\"/></div><p></p><h5><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">        林地城堡是最后的防线。</span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">        把路全部截断，做好伪装。</span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">        还有金银财宝、粮食武器，所有能带的东西都带过去。</span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">        我的愿望只有一个，就是在那里守到皇帝凯旋。</span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">        高卢必胜！</span></h5><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"a82cb89fd619b9d094c19c552ef04c33\" title=\"收集的物品.png\" alt=\"收集的物品.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/a82cb89fd619b9d094c19c552ef04c33.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"5584a6b1b83e71604177115d19ef2394\" title=\"20.png\" alt=\"20.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/5584a6b1b83e71604177115d19ef2394.png\"/></div><h6 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">您在本次探险中的所得均会忠实地呈现在视野可及的地方。</span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">收集它们、了解它们、使用它们，</span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">它们将成为您在古堡中最可靠的伙伴。</span></h6><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"cadc476060a80a06893b4dcdb5d6c832\" title=\"分隔栏大.png\" alt=\"分隔栏大.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220623/cadc476060a80a06893b4dcdb5d6c832.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"600b2d559565632f8358f9117ca50c52\" title=\"收藏品.png\" alt=\"收藏品.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/600b2d559565632f8358f9117ca50c52.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" id=\"f0a3c367976602f0b3ab8feb93f20366\" alt=\"收藏品12121.png\" title=\"收藏品12121.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20220104/f0a3c367976602f0b3ab8feb93f20366.png\" width=\"175px\" height=\"150px\" style=\"width:175px;height:150px\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【收藏品】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">数量众多，效果各异，是探索途中获得的主要物品。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">也有部分未知</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【收藏品】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">拥有额外的解锁条件。随着常规行动（不包括&lt;古堡观光&gt;难度）的探索不断深入，将会被逐步解锁（解锁时可同时获得蜡烛奖励）。解锁后，才可在后续的探索中获得，扩充您的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【猩红珍藏】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【猩红珍藏-长生者宝盒】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看您所获得的所有</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【收藏品】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"d54579e320fb36c5dbc380b5e71add46\" title=\"部分收藏品效果展示.png\" alt=\"部分收藏品效果展示.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/d54579e320fb36c5dbc380b5e71add46.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"fa567c3861f524e253a6002257abd9ab\" alt=\"生存助力.png\" title=\"生存助力.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/fa567c3861f524e253a6002257abd9ab.png\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width:;height:\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"65dbd9d944e8132377c29b0598226fb3\" alt=\"随便扣的带文字.png\" title=\"随便扣的带文字.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211230/65dbd9d944e8132377c29b0598226fb3.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"c7c00f8d3672bfb90fe1159d8d5c8425\" alt=\"斗争之物.png\" title=\"斗争之物.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/c7c00f8d3672bfb90fe1159d8d5c8425.png\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width:;height:\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"1216c5daf74d7a3a9cb4ce3524792bf4\" alt=\"舞者手链.png\" title=\"舞者手链.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211230/1216c5daf74d7a3a9cb4ce3524792bf4.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"1604f3cd08ff5951c47c9ad7e8ca91da\" alt=\"专业工具.png\" title=\"专业工具.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/1604f3cd08ff5951c47c9ad7e8ca91da.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"f635be794f1427eacea31e13dc66c8a3\" alt=\"尖刺之手.png\" title=\"尖刺之手.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211230/f635be794f1427eacea31e13dc66c8a3.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"21c825c1bc536c182803a6eca8ea892b\" alt=\"巧用收藏.png\" title=\"巧用收藏.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/21c825c1bc536c182803a6eca8ea892b.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"f4527272d7b30d00354029e24f74ed63\" alt=\"王庭盟约.png\" title=\"王庭盟约.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211230/f4527272d7b30d00354029e24f74ed63.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"60ec5cf8d4665682c567e08f8b74875a\" alt=\"叙事珍奇.png\" title=\"叙事珍奇.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/60ec5cf8d4665682c567e08f8b74875a.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"2edb833e408010b7ed3426ad48e81622\" alt=\"白英花.png\" title=\"白英花.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211230/2edb833e408010b7ed3426ad48e81622.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"6f4d35081d2ee5fc84153e4112c626e7\" alt=\"剧团之密.png\" title=\"剧团之密.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/6f4d35081d2ee5fc84153e4112c626e7.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"609dfa255c4e1493a0d2eb5f78a02462\" alt=\"夜骇.png\" title=\"夜骇.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211230/609dfa255c4e1493a0d2eb5f78a02462.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"baac3289c9f33c71b240abd04d9f2636\" alt=\"荣耀之证.png\" title=\"荣耀之证.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/baac3289c9f33c71b240abd04d9f2636.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"5a9b5fd37ca71a595c60e1606e73f0cc\" alt=\"酒神的印记.png\" title=\"酒神的印记.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211230/5a9b5fd37ca71a595c60e1606e73f0cc.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">此外........</span></span></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"ad97be36ad19540122043670d4dcc8d2\" alt=\"影响结局收藏品.png\" title=\"影响结局收藏品.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/ad97be36ad19540122043670d4dcc8d2.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"685a2ac5c67a16d26ca19861426c07a6\" title=\"剧目.png\" alt=\"剧目.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/685a2ac5c67a16d26ca19861426c07a6.png\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【剧目】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">是一种获取前效果未知，获取后仅在本层生效且生效后消失的临时正向增益。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【剧目】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">持有上限为1个。若持有</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【剧目】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">时遇到新的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【剧目】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，您可以选择是否替换当前</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【剧目】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【猩红珍藏-活页剧目集】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看您所获得的所有</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【剧目】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"a4c217c3560a2422741a3c93d5d21612\" title=\"效果展示2.png\" alt=\"效果展示2.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220628/a4c217c3560a2422741a3c93d5d21612.png\"/></div><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\"></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><img id=\"22de81b7c4ca967d09756a1f4df3961c\" title=\"战术道具.png\" alt=\"战术道具.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/22de81b7c4ca967d09756a1f4df3961c.png\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【战术道具】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">是一种携带后能在战斗内部署装置的道具。装备不同的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【战术道具】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，将会在战斗中带来不同的战术效果。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【战术道具】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">持有上限为1个。若持有战术道具时遇到新的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【战术道具】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，您可以选择是否替换当前</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【战术道具】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【猩红珍藏-战术道具箱】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看您所获得的的所有</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【战术道具】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\"></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"955110e74ee3ff1b9da60ba922cb2a61\" title=\"效果展示3.png\" alt=\"效果展示3.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220628/955110e74ee3ff1b9da60ba922cb2a61.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p></p><h6 style=\"text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">*图片仅供参考</span></h6>",
